{"id":"9dcb06e213d3e182","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-forcing12-pure-decision-property.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Pure Decision Property","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-pure-decision-property — ZFC Forcing12 Pure Decision Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-pure-decision-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-pure-decision-property"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-pure-decision-property — ZFC Forcing12 Pure Decision Property","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-pure-decision-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-pure-decision-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-pure-decision-property — ZFC Forcing12 Pure Decision Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,P,\\leq_P,\\leq^*,\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(M,P,\\leq_P,\\leq^*,\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (ground model, forcing, forcing order, pure order, and formula signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PureDecisionProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PureDecisionProperty}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (formula set for the explicit signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\">\\(p\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\)</span> (fully parameterized forcing relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>。此接口继续采用原文的空名字元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>；量化的公式满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}pure\\text{-}decision\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PureDecisionProperty}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,\\leq^*,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\leq^*\\subseteq\\leq_P\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\{\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi)=\\varnothing\\}\\;\\exists q\\in P\\;\n\\bigl(q\\leq^*p\\land(q\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\varnothing]\\lor q\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\neg\\varphi[\\varnothing])\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}pure\\text{-}decision\\text{-}property} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PureDecisionProperty}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,\\leq^*,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\leq^*\\subseteq\\leq_P\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\{\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\psi)=\\varnothing\\}\\;\\exists q\\in P\\;\n\\bigl(q\\leq^*p\\land(q\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\varphi[\\varnothing]\\lor q\\Vdash_{M,(P,\\leq_P)}\\neg\\varphi[\\varnothing])\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>公式语言参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 已进入谓词签名；不同语言的公式码不会再被混在同一个无参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 中。</li>\n<li>迫使记号显式携带序关系和空名字参数元组；同一载体上的不同 forcing 序不再被二元下标混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","